  "version": "1.0.0",
  "lifecycle": "alpha",
  "description": "A real link pinned to a viewport corner that opens a chat (a messaging deep link, a chat page or mailto). Round, pill or square. Enters once with a fade and rise and grows slightly on hover; both stop under reduced motion. Opens a new tab by default and says so. The icon is decorative; the name comes from the label.",
